# Mesh > View on a 3-D case (hotRadiationRoomFvDOM, fvDOM ray fields in 0/): the main fields come first in
# "colour by" (T was below the fold, after qr), typing a name ranks the exact match first, the cut moves across
# another axis, and Surface (3-D) lists the patches, which hide when clicked.
open $SB/ws/hotRoom
click nav:mesh
wait-until page Mesh
click text:View
wait 20
assert text cells cut
choose xs-field T
wait 20
assert text T at t = 0
click text:Cut across x
wait 20
assert text x =
assert text T at t = 0
click text:Surface (3-D)
wait 30
assert text fixedWalls
click text:ceiling
wait 5
assert text hidden
measure
quit
